1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,367
Where did this answer come from?

2
00:00:03,633 --> 00:00:07,833
One question captures the challenge of trust in Islamic knowledge.

3
00:00:07,867 --> 00:00:12,600
Qaf brings questions and sources closer together.

4
00:00:13,667 --> 00:00:16,667
Qaf helps researchers and readers explore a question,

5
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:19,200
and read cited passages in their context.

6
00:00:19,233 --> 00:00:24,233
Books, authors, and source locations remain alongside the answer.

7
00:00:25,667 --> 00:00:30,467
Jev. An experimental workflow that selects evidence before writing.

8
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:34,267
It classifies the question and evaluates the retrieved passages,

9
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:37,200
then reviews coverage and identifies the gaps.

10
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,800
Code controls the follow-up steps.

11
00:00:40,833 --> 00:00:44,000
Gemini then writes from a numbered evidence pack.

12
00:00:44,033 --> 00:00:47,933
Citation numbers resolve to known passages the reader can inspect.

13
00:00:49,133 --> 00:00:53,267
In the independent educational demo, we ask: how do we check a quotation?

14
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:58,067
We open a citation and see the passage advising us to read the surrounding sentences.

15
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:01,133
When evidence is missing, the demo states its limits.

16
00:01:02,333 --> 00:01:06,700
In a previous study using 48 questions,

17
00:01:06,733 --> 00:01:10,667
estimated mean cost was about 40% lower.

18
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:14,133
Median time to the first readable answer text fell

19
00:01:14,167 --> 00:01:18,667
from about thirteen seconds to less than ten.

20
00:01:19,833 --> 00:01:22,833
No quality advantage has been established:

21
00:01:22,867 --> 00:01:27,333
Twenty preferences for the experimental workflow, sixteen for production,

22
00:01:27,367 --> 00:01:31,067
and twelve undecided comparisons.

23
00:01:32,033 --> 00:01:34,933
The study predates the challenge, and its evaluation is automated.

24
00:01:34,967 --> 00:01:37,200
In the audit sample, serious errors were found

25
00:01:37,233 --> 00:01:39,933
in six of eighteen answers in each workflow.

26
00:01:41,067 --> 00:01:47,867
The submission provides an independent explanation and a demo with synthetic data,

27
00:01:47,900 --> 00:01:50,833
with documented results and limitations.

28
00:01:50,867 --> 00:01:55,067
Qaf. A clearer question. Evidence closer at hand.
